--- !u!1001 &956869207
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: A few days later...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "And now, a story that\u2019s been making headlines online."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "A couple\u2019s extraordinary story has been making headlines online."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: The two grew close through an online chat app before planning to meet
        in person for the first time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: But when they finally met face-to-face, something shocking and unexpected
        happened.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: Moments after meeting, one of them suddenly collapsed and lost consciousness.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: Meanwhile, claims are rapidly spreading that another person at the scene
        was the head of Plutos Industries, a company experiencing rapid growth.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: As a result, speculation and controversy surrounding Plutos Industries
        are spiraling out of control.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[8]'
      value: A spokesperson for Plutos Industries claims the company has no comment
        on the matter...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[9]'
      value: "<Ending 3/4 \u2014 Third Ending: Irony>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\uCD5C\uADFC \uB204\uB9AC\uAFBC\uB4E4 \uC0AC\uC774\uC5D0\uC11C \uD654\uC81C\uAC00
        \uB418\uACE0 \uC788\uB294 \uC18C\uC2DD \uD558\uB098 \uC804\uD574\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uD55C \uCEE4\uD50C\uC758 \uD2B9\uBCC4\uD55C \uC0AC\uC5F0\uC774 \uC628\uB77C\uC778\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uD654\uC81C\uAC00 \uB418\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uB450 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC740 \uC628\uB77C\uC778 \uCC44\uD305 \uC571\uC744
        \uACC4\uAE30\uB85C \uAC00\uAE4C\uC6CC\uC9C4 \uB4A4,\n\uC2E4\uC81C\uB85C \uB9CC\uB0A0
        \uACC4\uD68D\uC744 \uC138\uC6CC \uCC98\uC74C\uC73C\uB85C \uC11C\uB85C\uB97C
        \uB9C8\uC8FC\uD558\uAC8C \uB418\uC5C8\uB294\uB370\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uADF8\uB7F0\uB370 \uB450 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uB9C8\uCE68\uB0B4 \uB9C8\uC8FC\uD55C
        \uBC14\uB85C \uADF8 \uC21C\uAC04, \uC608\uC0C1\uCE58 \uBABB\uD55C \uCDA9\uACA9\uC801\uC778
        \uC0C1\uD669\uC774 \uBC8C\uC5B4\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\uB9CC\uB0A8 \uC9C1\uD6C4 \uD55C \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uADF8\uB300\uB85C
        \uC4F0\uB7EC\uC9C0\uBA70 \uC758\uC2DD\uC744 \uC783\uC740 \uAC83\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\uC774\uB7F0 \uAC00\uC6B4\uB370, \uD604\uC7A5\uC5D0 \uD568\uAED8 \uC788\uB358
        \uB610 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC778\uBB3C\uC774 \uCD5C\uADFC \uAE09\uACA9\uD55C \uC131\uC7A5\uC138\uB97C\n\uBCF4\uC774\uACE0
        \uC788\uB294 \uD50C\uB8E8\uD1A0\uC2A4\uACF5\uC5C5\uC758 \uCD1D\uCC45\uC784\uC790\uB77C\uB294
        \uC8FC\uC7A5\uC774 \uBE60\uB974\uAC8C \uD655\uC0B0\uB418\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: "\uC774\uB7EC\uD55C \uC8FC\uC7A5\uC758 \uD655\uC0B0\uC73C\uB85C \uD50C\uB8E8\uD1A0\uC2A4\uACF5\uC5C5\uC744
        \uB458\uB7EC\uC2FC \uC758\uD639\uACFC \uB17C\uB780 \uC5ED\uC2DC \uAC77\uC7A1\uC744
        \uC218 \uC5C6\uC774 \uCEE4\uC9C0\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[8]'
      value: "\uD50C\uB8E8\uD1A0\uC2A4\uACF5\uC5C5\uC758 \uB300\uBCC0\uC778\uC740
        \uD574\uB2F9 \uC0AC\uC548\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uB2F5\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uB294
        \uBC14\uAC00 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uACE0 \uC8FC\uC7A5\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        ..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[9]'
      value: "<Ending 3/4 \u2014 \uC138 \uBC88\uC9F8 \uC5D4\uB529: \uC544\uC774\uB7EC\uB2C8>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4981826221709989368, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: EndingTemplate
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
